{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/CodableConfiguration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" allows you to create "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"text":" types whose members don’t all conform to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For types that can’t support encoding and decoding by themselves but could become encodable and decodable with some statically-defined information, use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"@CodableConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" wrapper. This lets you assign a configuration provider — a type that conforms to both ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/EncodingConfigurationProviding","type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/DecodingConfigurationProviding"},{"type":"text","text":" — to supply this data."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Limiting the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/CodableConfiguration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to statically-defined information protects clients from loading unexpected data."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the following example, the "},{"code":"Message","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" type uses "},{"code":"@CodableConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString"},{"type":"text","text":" property called "},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". While "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString"},{"type":"text","text":" does conform to "},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", it can only encode its known attributes — those declared by the platform SDK — as part of this conformance. By adding a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/CodableConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":" for the custom "},{"code":"MyAttributes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" type, "},{"code":"Message","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" uses "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/EncodableWithConfiguration\/encode(to:configuration:)"},{"type":"text","text":" when encoding "},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which preserves the custom attributes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Message: Codable {","let date: Date","let sender: Person","@CodableConfiguration(from: MyAttributes.self) var content = AttributedString()","}"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A property wrapper that makes a type codable, by supplying a configuration that provides additional information for serialization."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/Se","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SE","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SQ","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SH","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Serializing arbitrary payloads","generated":true,"anchor":"Serializing-arbitrary-payloads","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/CodableWithConfiguration","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/DecodableWithConfiguration","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/do